  "html": "<div class=\"wp-block-group alignfull has-white-color has-text-color has-background\" style=\"background:linear-gradient(135deg,rgba(121,219,180,0.69) 0%,rgb(0,208,130) 100%);padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--60);padding-right:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--60);padding-left:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40)\"><div class=\"wp-block-group__inner-container\">\n<h1 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center has-white-color has-text-color\" style=\"font-size:clamp(2rem, 5vw, 3.5rem);font-weight:800;line-height:1.1\">Smart business cards from R299. Made in SA.</h1>\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center has-ast-global-color-3-color has-text-color\" style=\"font-size:1.15rem;line-height:1.5\">Tap-to-share NFC business cards that connect to your free MeCard profile. Pick the card. Sign up free. Order from inside your management console.</p>\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons is-layout-flex wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex is-content-justification-center\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link has-primary-color has-ast-global-color-0-background-color has-text-color has-background has-custom-font-size wp-element-button\" href=\"/sign-up/\" style=\"padding-top:1rem;padding-right:2rem;padding-bottom:1rem;padding-left:2rem;font-size:1.1rem;font-weight:700\">Sign up free, then order</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center has-ast-global-color-3-color has-text-color\" style=\"font-size:0.9rem\">Already a member? <a href=\"/my-account/\">Log in to order</a></p>\n</div></div>\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group alignwide is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\" style=\"padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--50);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--50)\"><div class=\"wp-block-group__inner-container\">\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\">Pick the card that fits</h2>\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns is-layout-flex wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" style=\"font-size:1.4rem;font-weight:700\">Classic</h3>\n\n<p class=\"has-primary-color has-text-color\" style=\"margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;font-size:0.99rem;font-weight:700\">R299</p>\n\n<p>NFC tap-to-share with a clean MeCard finish. Encoded to your profile when you order. Includes the free profile.</p>\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>NFC chip with QR fallback</li>\n\n<li>Made and shipped from South Africa</li>\n\n<li>Order from your management console after signup</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-large is-resized\"><img src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2022/11/mecard-classic-front-1-1024x682.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-11165\" style=\"aspect-ratio:1.501451442646024;width:354px;height:auto\"/></figure>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"height:41px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns is-layout-flex wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" style=\"font-size:1.4rem;font-weight:700\">Custom</h3>\n\n<p class=\"has-primary-color has-text-color\" style=\"margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;font-size:0.99rem;font-weight:700\">R399</p>\n\n<p>Printed with your design or company branding. Same NFC tap-to-share, your look. Includes the free profile.</p>\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Upload artwork inside the management console</li>\n\n<li>NFC tap-to-share with QR fallback</li>\n\n<li>Made and shipped from South Africa</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-full is-resized\"><img src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/alessio-card-rounded-drop-s.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-79758\" style=\"aspect-ratio:1.501451442646024;width:354px;height:auto\"/></figure>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"height:41px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns is-layout-flex wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\" style=\"flex-basis:50%\">\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" style=\"font-size:1.4rem;font-weight:700\">Bundle</h3>\n\n<p class=\"has-primary-color has-text-color\" style=\"margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;font-size:0.99rem;font-weight:700\">from R499</p>\n\n<p>Pair a card with a phone tag and get both at a single price. The phone tag is a NFC sticker for the back of your phone — tap someone's phone with yours to share. The bundle is the only way to add a phone tag.</p>\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Classic or Custom card + phone tag</li>\n\n<li>Both encoded to your profile</li>\n\n<li>See bundle pricing inside the management console</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\" style=\"flex-basis:10%\"></div>\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\" style=\"flex-basis:30%\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-full is-resized\"><img src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2022/02/custom_bundle_new.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-76156\" style=\"aspect-ratio:0.848671875;width:298px;height:auto\"/></figure>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\" style=\"flex-basis:10%\"></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns alignwide is-layout-flex wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\"></div>\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\"></div>\n</div>\n</div></div>\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group alignfull has-light-gray-background-color has-background\" style=\"padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--50);padding-right:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--50);padding-left:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40)\"><div class=\"wp-block-group__inner-container\">\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\">How ordering works</h2>\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center\">Each card is encoded to your profile, so you sign up first. It takes 60 seconds and the profile is free either way.</p>\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns alignwide is-layout-flex wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column has-ast-global-color-4-background-color has-background is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\" style=\"border-top-left-radius:10px;border-top-right-radius:10px;border-bottom-left-radius:10px;border-bottom-right-radius:10px;padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--20);padding-right:var(--wp--preset--spacing--20);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--20);padding-left:var(--wp--preset--spacing--20)\">\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" style=\"font-size:1.2rem;font-weight:700\">1. Sign up free</h3>\n\n<p>Sign in with Google or email. Three fields and you have a live profile.</p>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column has-ast-global-color-4-background-color has-background is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\" style=\"border-top-left-radius:10px;border-top-right-radius:10px;border-bottom-left-radius:10px;border-bottom-right-radius:10px;padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--20);padding-right:var(--wp--preset--spacing--20);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--20);padding-left:var(--wp--preset--spacing--20)\">\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" style=\"font-size:1.2rem;font-weight:700\">2. Pick your card</h3>\n\n<p>Choose Classic, Custom, or a bundle from inside your management console. Upload your design if it’s a Custom card.</p>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column has-ast-global-color-4-background-color has-background is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\" style=\"border-top-left-radius:10px;border-top-right-radius:10px;border-bottom-left-radius:10px;border-bottom-right-radius:10px;padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--20);padding-right:var(--wp--preset--spacing--20);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--20);padding-left:var(--wp--preset--spacing--20)\">\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" style=\"font-size:1.2rem;font-weight:700\">3. Tap to share</h3>\n\n<p>We make and post the card to you. Tap it on someone’s phone to share your profile.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div></div>\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group alignwide is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\" style=\"padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--50);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--50)\"><div class=\"wp-block-group__inner-container\">\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\">Frequently asked</h2>\n\n<div style=\"height:20px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" style=\"font-size:1.15rem;font-weight:700\">Why do I have to sign up before ordering?</h3>\n\n<p>Your card is encoded to your unique MeCard profile. We need that profile to exist before we can make the card. Signup is free, takes 60 seconds, and the profile is yours to keep whether or not you buy a card.</p>\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" style=\"font-size:1.15rem;font-weight:700\">What’s the difference between Classic and Custom?</h3>\n\n<p>Classic (R299) carries a clean MeCard finish with your company logo, name and job title. Custom (R399) is printed with your design or company branding. Both have the same NFC tap-to-share. Pick Custom if you want to supply your own custom design.</p>\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" style=\"font-size:1.15rem;font-weight:700\">Does the card work on iPhones?</h3>\n\n<p>Yes. Modern iPhones (iPhone 7 and later) read NFC tags out of the box — no app required. Older or non-NFC phones can scan the QR code printed on the card.</p>\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" style=\"font-size:1.15rem;font-weight:700\">How long does delivery take?</h3>\n\n<p>Cards are made and shipped in South Africa. Delivery times depend on the card type and your location — details are confirmed at the time of order.</p>\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" style=\"font-size:1.15rem;font-weight:700\">What if I order cards for a team?</h3>\n\n<p>Teams have a dedicated console for managing multiple profiles and ordering in bulk. Start there: <a href=\"/for-teams/\">For teams</a>.</p>\n</div></div>\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group alignfull has-white-color has-primary-background-color has-text-color has-background\" style=\"padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--50);padding-right:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--50);padding-left:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40)\"><div class=\"wp-block-group__inner-container\">\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center has-ast-global-color-3-color has-text-color\" style=\"font-weight:800\">Order your Smart Business Card</h2>\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center has-ast-global-color-3-color has-text-color\">60 seconds to a free profile. Then order your Classic, Custom or bundle from inside.</p>\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons is-layout-flex wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex is-content-justification-center\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link has-primary-color has-ast-global-color-0-background-color has-text-color has-background has-custom-font-size wp-element-button\" href=\"/sign-up/\" style=\"padding-top:1rem;padding-right:2rem;padding-bottom:1rem;padding-left:2rem;font-size:1.1rem;font-weight:700\">Sign up free</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center has-white-color has-text-color\" style=\"font-size:0.9rem\">Already a member? <a href=\"/my-account/\">Log in to order</a></p>\n</div></div>"
}
